# The frozen syscall ABI (libs/lazyos-sys, docs/update-plan.md decision 18).
#
#   <namespace> <number> <NAME> since <abi> [removed <abi>]
#
# Append-only: a constant in `nr`, `msg::op` or `dev::op` is never renumbered
# or renamed. A new one is added here with `since <KERNEL_ABI + 1>` and
# `abi::KERNEL_ABI` is bumped in the same change. A removal gets
# `removed <abi>` (not a deleted line), raises KERNEL_ABI_COMPAT_FROM to that
# ABI, and waits two snapshots after the deprecation. The test is
# tests/abi_freeze.rs.
device 0 LIST since 1
device 1 CLAIM since 1
device 2 MAP_BAR since 1
device 3 PIO since 1
device 4 CFG_READ since 1
device 5 CFG_WRITE since 1
device 6 IRQ_ENABLE since 1
device 7 IRQ_ACK since 1
device 8 RELEASE since 1
device 9 DMA_ALLOC since 1
device 10 INVENTORY since 1
device 11 POLICY since 1
device 12 DENIALS since 1
device 13 DBG_CONFIG_READ since 1
device 14 DBG_MMIO_READ since 1
messenger 1 CALL since 1
messenger 1 CLOSE_RELEASE since 1
messenger 1 ENDPOINT_FD_CLOEXEC since 1
messenger 1 RECV_SENDER_ID since 1
messenger 2 REPLY since 1
messenger 3 SEND since 1
messenger 4 RECV since 1
messenger 5 CANCEL since 1
messenger 6 CLOSE_ENDPOINT since 1
messenger 7 CREATE_PAIR since 1
messenger 8 STATS since 1
messenger 9 BOOTSTRAP since 1
messenger 10 CALL_BEGIN since 1
messenger 11 CALL_AWAIT since 1
messenger 12 TOTALS since 1
messenger 13 REGISTER since 1
messenger 14 RESOLVE since 1
messenger 15 UNREGISTER since 1
messenger 16 LIST since 1
messenger 17 AUTHORIZE_TOPIC since 1
messenger 18 ACL_LOAD since 1
messenger 19 WAIT since 1
messenger 20 CONNECT since 1
messenger 21 ENDPOINT_FD since 1
messenger 22 BUFFER_CREATE since 1
messenger 23 BUFFER_MAP since 1
messenger 24 BUFFER_CLOSE since 1
messenger 25 CALL_CHECK since 1
messenger 26 CALL_DRAIN since 1
native 0 EXIT since 1
